OL,3,AWorkers should get paid time off to
OL,4,Atrain for crises, say peers
OL,5,
OL,6,FWorkers should be able to take paid
OL,7,Ftime off to prepare for national
OL,8,Femergencies, a House of Lords committee
OL,9,Fhas recommended.
OL,11,FIn a report, the peers said a new
OL,12,F"civic resilience leave" would enable
OL,13,Femployees to undertake training and
OL,14,Femergency volunteering without losing
OL,15,Fincome.
OL,17,FIt is one of a slew of recommendations
OL,18,Ffrom a 12-strong committee that has
OL,19,Fbeen examining how to make the UK
OL,20,Fbetter able to respond to crises
OL,21,Fincluding war, power cuts,
OL,22,Fcyber-attacks and natural disasters.
OL,23,APub: 16-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
