OL,3,AWorkers should get paid time off to
OL,4,Atrain for crises, say peers
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt comes after the government launched
OL,7,Fa campaign calling on the British
OL,8,Fpublic to stock up on tinned food and
OL,9,Fbottled water to be prepared for
OL,10,Femergencies.
